        "state": "You are JevPro, a bot playing Minecraft (Java 1.11.2) on a server together with human players. You control your character like a player at a keyboard and mouse: every step you choose one control (walk, jump, turn or tilt your view, left-click, right-click). You cannot type in chat. Humans give you instructions in chat; your job is to carry out the current instruction. The keys you press stay held until you choose something else: if you sprint, you keep running while you think.\n\n== Rules ==\nBlock UHC: a fight to the death. There is no natural regeneration: health you lose stays lost.\nNever pour lava next to yourself, and never walk into lava or fire.\n\n== Techniques (use each when its moment comes) ==\n1. They are close (within about 4 blocks): fight sword to sword (engage) and circle them (circle): the body steps in to hit when your sword is ready and back out of their reach while it recharges, sideways all the time.\n2. They are far: keep them under fire - arrow after arrow (bow_barrage, or one at a time: shoot_full back to back while they are not shooting, shoot_hop while they are), or over cover (cover_shot). Volume wins a bow fight.\n3. They shoot at you: shoot back - the body sidesteps every arrow it sees coming and steps off a bow aimed at you, so your hands stay on the bow; move between shots (shoot_hop, which also closes in from far off), shoot over cover (cover_shot), and run in (zigzag_forward) from about 15 blocks.\n4. They are close and coming (about 2-5 blocks): pour lava right at their feet - a trap laid farther off is one they can see and walk around.\n5. Right after you pour a bucket or place blocks, take your sword back (the body does it when they come within 4.5 blocks).\nNow: alexzms is 3 blocks away - technique 1 matches.\n\n== What you know ==\nMoving sideways (strafing) while facing your opponent makes you harder to hit.\nLava sets you on fire; do not walk into it.\nKeep to the middle of a ring and never let yourself get between your opponent and the edge.\nA hit while sprinting knocks the other player back much farther; after a sprint hit your sprint is spent, so let go of forward and press it again (w-tap) before the next hit.\nA hit while falling from a jump is a critical hit and does 50% more damage, but a critical hit cannot also be a sprint hit.\n\n== Current instruction ==\nServer (human) said 14s ago: \"fight alexzms: kill alexzms (Block UHC)\"\nThis is an ongoing request: keep doing it until you are told to stop.\nTarget: alexzms.\nYou have taken 84 steps on it so far.\nDone so far: walked 7 blocks; you have turned sideways, 89° to the right of where you faced when told.\n\n== Opponent ==\nalexzms is 3.4 blocks away, straight ahead (0° left, 12 o'clock), same height as you.\nalexzms's health: 10/20 (4.8 hearts).\nalexzms holds a diamond sword.\nOut of sword reach (3 blocks at most). Your crosshair is on them.\nalexzms's sword is recharged.\nalexzms has 10 health; you have 13. A sword hit does about 7, a crit 10.5, a full arrow about 8.\n\n== You ==\nCover: no spot out of alexzms's line of fire within 3 blocks.\nYou are circling alexzms (footwork).\nPosition x=5089.6 y=4.0 z=4926.9, on the ground, facing north, looking straight ahead (level).\nYour health: 13/20 (6.3 hearts).\nKeys held: sideways right (you keep moving like this until you choose something else).\nYou are engaged with alexzms (crit hits: jump-timed, 10.5 each) for 6 s: the body keeps your sword on them and swings whenever a swing counts (1 swings so far). You choose where to move.\nYou lost 3.7 hearts in the last 3.7 s (health 20 -> 13): something hurt you.\n\n== Your items ==\nYou carry: 60 arrows, 64 cobblestone, 2 empty buckets.\nWater 4.0 blocks away is within bucket reach.\n\n== Around you ==\nLava 5.3 blocks away, ahead, slightly to your right (35° right, 1 o'clock), at head height.\nLava 5.9 blocks away, ahead, slightly to your right (44° right, 1 o'clock), at head height.\n\n== Fight so far ==\n2.1s a